# Viola: notes held together are bowed together on adjacent strings.
# A moving line over a held open D, then sustained and short chords.
tempo 60
0 poly on
0 dyn 0.5
0 vib 0.5
0 on D4 70              # open D, held under the line on the A string
0 note A4 1.05 70
1 note B4 1.05 70
2 note C#5 1.05 70
3 note D5 1.9 80
3 off D4
5 note G3 1.9 70        # a sixth: open G, E4 on the D string
5 note E4 1.9 70
7 note A3 1.9 70        # a third: A3 on the C string, C4 on the G string
7 note C4 1.9 70
9 bow on
9 note G3 0.2 90        # short chords on the string: both notes in one stroke
9 note D4 0.2 90
9.5 note G3 0.2 90
9.5 note D4 0.2 90
10 note C4 0.2 90
10 note G4 0.2 90
